D.113.0100. - The system shall support the ability to add Missing Data Codes to fields.
D.113.0200. - The system shall support the ability to enable/disable Data History Popup for all data collection instruments.
D.113.0300. - The system shall support the ability to prevent branching logic from hiding fields that have values. 
D.113.0400. - The system shall support the ability to provide a reason for change when editing instruments. 